    "notes": "J10. Six actual action stages each facing: hook/disarm intact training blade, step back, open left palm allowing unharmed partner to breathe, take existing sealed mission case by handle, rise holding case, real departure step. Independent final QA opened all four originals and confirmed case present from A1 onward, not spawned at pickup; same two-latch closed case remains identifiable despite minor native proportions/trim variation. Shield stays anatomical LEFT, intact spear RIGHT and blades retracted. Final exit turns intentionally away from the partner and is not an erroneous mirrored facing. Gray articulated adult-sized neutral mannequin, dropped blade and case are baked scene-study props; no narrative victim, synchronized real opponent, campaign mission object/reward or inventory/disarm mechanic is implemented. Fixed MASK-crown-to-Feral-soles scale and manually reviewed Feral feet exclude mannequin, blade and case ground pixels. Calibrations are excluded; playback durations are for visual inspection, not source mechanics."
